01:50:45.725 --> 01:50:49.374
and you'll get challenged in ways that you can't foresee.

2796
01:50:49.374 --> 01:50:50.237
Totally.
You know what I mean.

2797
01:50:50.237 --> 01:50:52.641
And it's like, it puts right in front of you whatever it is

2798
01:50:52.641 --> 01:50:54.685
that you need to look at within yourself.

2799
01:50:54.685 --> 01:50:57.590
100% and I love that,

2800
01:50:57.590 --> 01:50:59.237
I mean, the challenge of being a dad, right?

2801
01:50:59.237 --> 01:51:00.429
That's the hardest thing I've done

2802
01:51:00.429 --> 01:51:02.622
and I have a friend who's about to become a dad

2803
01:51:02.622 --> 01:51:03.550
in like couple months.

2804
01:51:03.550 --> 01:51:05.470
It is also, there's no second place,

2805
01:51:05.470 --> 01:51:07.137
there's not even like, there's no podium,

2806
01:51:07.137 --> 01:51:08.428
it's like the first, second and third

2807
01:51:08.428 --> 01:51:09.728
best thing I've ever done, right?

2808
01:51:09.728 --> 01:51:11.340
So, it's so cool, right?

2809
01:51:11.340 --> 01:51:13.141
Yeah.

2810
01:51:13.141 --> 01:51:14.914
And it's the hardest, it's so hard,

2811
01:51:14.914 --> 01:51:17.629
you just give up everything,

2812
01:51:17.629 --> 01:51:18.966
I'm not complaining.

2813
01:51:18.966 --> 01:51:21.095
This should roll out on Father's Day actually,

2814
01:51:21.095 --> 01:51:21.928
you could bank it.

2815
01:51:21.928 --> 01:51:22.761
When is Father's Day?

2816
01:51:22.761 --> 01:51:23.944
It's like June or something.

2817
01:51:23.944 --> 01:51:24.841
Maybe it will, we'll see.

2818
01:51:24.841 --> 01:51:28.425
And you've got to get this once a year.

2819
01:51:28.425 --> 01:51:29.432
Well, if we're going to do that,

2820
01:51:29.432 --> 01:51:30.309
then you gotta take it out,

2821
01:51:30.309 --> 01:51:32.487
you gotta take it out on a positive Father's Day.

2822
01:51:32.487 --> 01:51:34.320
Yeah, in positive...

2823
01:51:39.362 --> 01:51:44.029
Typewritten letter to the the erstwhile fathers to be.

2824
01:51:45.393 --> 01:51:46.623
Fathers to be,

2825
01:51:46.623 --> 01:51:49.623
friends at St. John in North county.

2826
01:51:52.821 --> 01:51:54.402
I tell new dads this all the time,

2827
01:51:54.402 --> 01:51:56.531
it's not like anything,

2828
01:51:56.531 --> 01:52:00.766
it's not like going to grad school and late nights,

2829
01:52:00.766 --> 01:52:03.499
it's not like being tired or sleeplessness,

2830
01:52:03.499 --> 01:52:05.258
it's not like, it's not there isn't,

2831
01:52:05.258 --> 01:52:07.341
there isn't a comparison.

2832
01:52:09.147 --> 01:52:13.348
And you also don't love anything like this,

2833
01:52:13.348 --> 01:52:17.285
it's not like your favorite team home game

2834
01:52:17.285 --> 01:52:18.244
against the Yankees.

2835
01:52:18.244 --> 01:52:20.391
It's not like the best experience,

2836
01:52:20.391 --> 01:52:23.600
and so, I don't speak this way that often,

2837
01:52:23.600 --> 01:52:24.491
but I really believe in it.

2838
01:52:24.491 --> 01:52:28.158
And so, when that comes planned or otherwise

2839
01:52:30.074 --> 01:52:33.298
and you're going to be a dad, it's like,

2840
01:52:33.298 --> 01:52:36.234
don't try and understand it, just live it,

2841
01:52:36.234 --> 01:52:37.801
live it, live right through it,

2842
01:52:37.801 --> 01:52:40.218
and keep your eyes wide open,

2843
01:52:43.023 --> 01:52:45.665
and keep your phone far away from you.

2844
01:52:45.665 --> 01:52:49.123
And ironically, still take a lot of pictures somehow

2845
01:52:49.123 --> 01:52:51.206
and drink a lot of water.

2846
01:52:54.839 --> 01:52:56.149
Say, please, and thank you.

2847
01:52:56.149 --> 01:52:56.982
Hydration.

2848
01:52:56.982 --> 01:52:58.428
I actually don't care a lot about the rules

2849
01:52:58.428 --> 01:53:00.480
in our house, like we're gonna raise Lumi this way

2850
01:53:00.480 --> 01:53:03.753
but I drill the please and thank you thing, my dad did.

2851
01:53:03.753 --> 01:53:05.362
So, my kid is like this wacky loud mouth

2852
01:53:05.362 --> 01:53:06.820
but he says please and thank you a lot, I'm fine,

2853
01:53:06.820 --> 01:53:08.151
that's good.

2854
01:53:08.151 --> 01:53:09.931
So, just pick your battles, I would say

2855
01:53:09.931 --> 01:53:11.154
that's an important one.

2856
01:53:11.154 --> 01:53:12.803
Like how you think you're going to shape your kid,

2857
01:53:12.803 --> 01:53:14.268
good luck, it probably won't go that way,

2858
01:53:14.268 --> 01:53:16.402
but if there are things that are worth

2859
01:53:16.402 --> 01:53:17.882
picking your battles for and stick by it,

2860
01:53:17.882 --> 01:53:20.470
the please and thank you thing, that's big,

2861
01:53:20.470 --> 01:53:24.040
and then don't think you're going to figure it out.

2862
01:53:24.040 --> 01:53:26.915
I used to surf with a guy who told me with all confidence,

2863
01:53:26.915 --> 01:53:29.068
he was three or four weeks away from becoming a dad.

2864
01:53:29.068 --> 01:53:30.873
He said, yeah we decided we're not really going

2865
01:53:30.873 --> 01:53:32.565
to do a stroller.

2866
01:53:32.565 --> 01:53:34.702
We're just going, I don't know,

2867
01:53:34.702 --> 01:53:36.249
I'll probably just get like a backpack or something

2868
01:53:36.249 --> 01:53:38.049
and like, Coachella's coming up,

2869
01:53:38.049 --> 01:53:39.019
so, we'll probably still,

2870
01:53:39.019 --> 01:53:40.000
I mean definitely still going

2871
01:53:40.000 --> 01:53:41.417
and I was like...

2872
01:53:42.874 --> 01:53:44.381
And you've done a good job of this biting your tongue,

2873
01:53:44.381 --> 01:53:46.204
but like, what are you talking about?

2874
01:53:46.204 --> 01:53:49.804
Like keeping your own opinion on the side of,

2875
01:53:49.804 --> 01:53:53.300
there's times when you know it's not about you.

2876
01:53:53.300 --> 01:53:54.133
Let me know how that goes.

2877
01:53:54.133 --> 01:53:55.417
Cool, yeah, no stroller dope,

2878
01:53:55.417 --> 01:53:56.865
like, meanwhile, I didn't ever think I was,

2879
01:53:56.865 --> 01:53:57.760
I have three strollers,

2880
01:53:57.760 --> 01:53:58.593
like, you know what I mean?

2881
01:53:58.593 --> 01:53:59.915
So, like this idea of like controlling the future,

2882
01:53:59.915 --> 01:54:00.790
like you know.

2883
01:54:00.790 --> 01:54:05.630
So, to my dads out there, you will never get the credit

2884
01:54:05.630 --> 01:54:08.213
and there's so much more to do.

2885
01:54:09.109 --> 01:54:11.521
And being a positive male role model,

2886
01:54:11.521 --> 01:54:13.517
I think is an important thing.

2887
01:54:13.517 --> 01:54:14.350
It's the best.

2888
01:54:14.350 --> 01:54:19.350
And guide your kid to a life with anti-racist work in it

2889
01:54:19.766 --> 01:54:22.456
'cause I think that that's the place

2890
01:54:22.456 --> 01:54:24.259
where we can make the biggest change,

2891
01:54:24.259 --> 01:54:26.531
the quickest change, even though it seems like years

2892
01:54:26.531 --> 01:54:27.819
and years, decades and decades,

2893
01:54:27.819 --> 01:54:32.125
like I think those are the changes we'll see quickest, so...

2894
01:54:32.125 --> 01:54:33.398
Beautiful, man.

2895
01:54:33.398 --> 01:54:35.373
There's only one thing that I would add to that,

2896
01:54:35.373 --> 01:54:39.368
which is in those moments where you're being tested,

2897
01:54:39.368 --> 01:54:42.156
which are going to be more frequent than you expect

2898
01:54:42.156 --> 01:54:44.510
and you feel like I gotta get outta here

2899
01:54:44.510 --> 01:54:45.769
'cause I gotta do that thing

2900
01:54:45.769 --> 01:54:46.889
or I'm gonna call that guy.

2901
01:54:46.889 --> 01:54:51.638
It's just like, remember, this passes so quickly,

2902
01:54:51.638 --> 01:54:53.716
I've been doing this for a long time,

2903
01:54:53.716 --> 01:54:56.488
and when I see the videos of you with Lumi,

2904
01:54:56.488 --> 01:54:58.841
I'm like, man, it doesn't seem like it was that long ago.

2905
01:54:58.841 --> 01:55:02.001
And then I look at my kids and they're so much older

2906
01:55:02.001 --> 01:55:05.018
and you forget how quickly it passes

2907
01:55:05.018 --> 01:55:07.096
and just to be able to be present

2908
01:55:07.096 --> 01:55:10.164
and appreciate what's actually transpiring,

2909
01:55:10.164 --> 01:55:12.687
it's great to say, put the phone away

2910
01:55:12.687 --> 01:55:14.704
but like, how present are you?

2911
01:55:14.704 --> 01:55:17.087
We're going to climb a tree and just forget

2912
01:55:17.087 --> 01:55:20.718
about what your agenda is and just be,

2913
01:55:20.718 --> 01:55:21.892
'cause it's not about like,

2914
01:55:21.892 --> 01:55:24.019
I'm gonna create the ultimate day

2915
01:55:24.019 --> 01:55:25.448
and we're going to go to the amusement park,

2916
01:55:25.448 --> 01:55:26.295
it's not about that.

2917
01:55:26.295 --> 01:55:27.216
Right.
It's just like,

2918
01:55:27.216 --> 01:55:28.908
just be present with the kids

2919
01:55:28.908 --> 01:55:32.494
and give that child your full attention.

2920
01:55:32.494 --> 01:55:36.518
And that's the most powerful and greatest gifts

2921
01:55:36.518 --> 01:55:38.522
that you can do, you can give

2922
01:55:38.522 --> 01:55:39.839
That's really well said, it's not the stuff,

2923
01:55:39.839 --> 01:55:41.266
it's not the right hamper,

2924
01:55:41.266 --> 01:55:42.819
it's not the right wall color, it's not the crib,

2925
01:55:42.819 --> 01:55:44.869
it's just like, if you can do those things,

2926
01:55:44.869 --> 01:55:46.043
you could be playing a bucket of sand,

2927
01:55:46.043 --> 01:55:47.204
it doesn't matter.

2928
01:55:47.204 --> 01:55:48.898
So, that's that man,

2929
01:55:48.898 --> 01:55:49.731
I really connect with that.

2930
01:55:49.731 --> 01:55:54.148
So, once again, Rich Roll, it's been an honor my man.

2931
01:55:55.288 --> 01:55:56.121
I love you brother.

2932
01:55:56.121 --> 01:55:56.954
Love you too.

2933
01:55:56.954 --> 01:55:58.727
Yeah.
I'm really proud of you

2934
01:55:58.727 --> 01:56:00.684
for coming to the twin cities during this...

2935
01:56:00.684 --> 01:56:01.946
Why?

2936
01:56:01.946 --> 01:56:05.863
You gave me a reason to go on an adventure too,

2937
01:56:07.277 --> 01:56:09.100
and I'm really happy to be here

2938
01:56:09.100 --> 01:56:13.100
and I feel excited about what I'm going to learn

2939
01:56:15.076 --> 01:56:16.088
over the next a couple of days.

2940
01:56:16.088 --> 01:56:17.111
Yeah, yeah.

2941
01:56:17.111 --> 01:56:21.558
It's it's an important time, before people start talking

2942
01:56:21.558 --> 01:56:24.381
about what we're doing with our hours in this time,

2943
01:56:24.381 --> 01:56:26.073
during this time and the sensitivity around it,

2944
01:56:26.073 --> 01:56:28.465
let's agree that it's an important time.

2945
01:56:28.465 --> 01:56:29.515
And if you're a storyteller

2946
01:56:29.515 --> 01:56:31.770
and if people listen to you and you have influence

2947
01:56:31.770 --> 01:56:35.446
and a platform, which is undeniable, then you belong here,

2948
01:56:35.446 --> 01:56:37.162
you need to be here, so.

2949
01:56:37.162 --> 01:56:38.799
Thanks man, thanks for bringing me out.

2950
01:56:38.799 --> 01:56:40.038
Peace, plants.

2951
01:56:40.038 --> 01:56:40.871
Namaste.

